Project: VibeCheck (Next.js + React + Node.js)

Database: PostgreSQL (strictly avoid Oracle references)

Hardware: NVIDIA DGX OS with Blackwell GPU

Strategy: Use DeepSeek-R1 70B for Planning and Qwen2.5-Coder 32B for Acting.

Instruction: Always use the Postgres MCP to verify table schema before writing any queries.
Instruction: Use puppeteer to access websites on the internet.

Tech Stack:
  - Frontend: Next.js, React, Tailwind CSS
  - Backend: Node.js, TypeScript, Express
  - Database: PostgreSQL with pg and pgvector
  - Config: dotenv
  - CORS: cors
  - Scheduling: node-cron
  - AI/LLM tooling: @langchain/core, @langchain/community, @langchain/google-genai, @langchain/langgraph, @langchain/ollama
  - Build tools: TypeScript, ts-node, nodemon
  - Web Scraping: puppeteer
